# Overview

Sonara is a Linux-First DAW built on Rust and Godot Engine.

Audio engine is in ./Engine while the godot project is in ./Godot

OSC is used for communication between backend audio and godot front end.

## Conventions

- Middle C = C3 = Midi #60
- 960 PPQ standard

## Project Tracking

- `STATUS.md` documents the current task: spell out the active objective, note what parts already work, and highlight what is still broken or blocked (use short “Working” / “Not Working” sections or bullet lists). Refresh it whenever focus shifts or status changes.
- `TODO.md` holds the backlog with checkbox items. Mark tasks `[x]` only after the feature is verified working, and add new `[ ]` entries as fresh tasks emerge.
- Keep both files concise and actionable so engineers can glance them to understand what to tackle next.
